<title>UK: Croatia prices $300 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Croatia prices $300 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers UBS and Merrill Lynch, has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CROATIA</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    27.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.917    PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    99.917    SPREAD	+80 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB-	DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
